Subject: [PATCH] Restore Apple Alpine Ridge controllers across S3

Backport the tested Thunderbolt suspend preparation and its PCI state
and ACPICA address-resolution prerequisites to Ubuntu 7.0.0-43.43.
Retain the older optional NHI operations and the mutex-held hook.
Original author submissions and signatures are retained separately.

---
